---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6 pb-[72px] pt-6">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 rounded-3xl bg-ink p-[clamp(28px,5vw,64px)] text-cream">
    <h2 class="m-0 max-w-[620px] font-display text-[clamp(30px,4vw,48px)] font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em]">
      Price the future of <span class="text-accent">inference</span>.
    </h2>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href={site.appUrl} class="btn-accent min-h-12 rounded-xl px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] no-underline">Open the Terminal</a>
      <a href={site.xUrl} class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-xl border border-cream/30 px-6 py-3.5 font-display text-[15px] font-medium text-cream no-underline hover:text-accent">Follow {site.xHandle}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1200px] flex-wrap justify-between gap-6 border-t border-line px-6 pb-12 pt-8 text-[13px] text-muted">
  <div class="flex max-w-[560px] flex-col gap-2">
    <span class="font-display text-base font-bold text-ink">ICM</span>
    <span>Inference capital markets, built on Orbio CREDIT. Rates are variable and depend on ORBIO trading volume. Nothing here is financial advice.</span>
  </div>
  <nav aria-label="Footer" class="flex flex-wrap items-start gap-5">
    <a href="/#terminal" class="text-body">Terminal</a>
    <a href={site.docsUrl} class="text-body">Docs</a>
    <a href={site.orbioUrl} class="text-body" rel="noopener">Orbio CREDIT ↗</a>
    <a href={site.xUrl} class="text-body">X ↗</a>
  </nav>
</footer>
